    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Situated just 600 metres from the vibrant coastal town of Kilkee, this charming three-bedroom semi-detached residence enjoys a highly convenient location within easy walking distance of the town’s wide range of amenities and, most notably, the beautiful beach that forms the centrepiece of this sought-after seaside community.\r\n\r\nKilkee is a charming and picturesque town, renowned for its beautiful horseshoe-shaped beach which forms the focal point of the town. Residents and visitors alike can enjoy a wonderful selection of cafés, restaurants, traditional pubs, breathtaking cliff walks, and a wide range of water-based activities including swimming, surfing, and kayaking.\r\n\r\nWhile the property would benefit from some modernisation and upgrading, it presents an excellent opportunity for purchasers seeking a home with genuine potential to create a residence tailored to their own tastes and standards. The accommodation offers a practical layout with three bedrooms and comfortable living space, providing a solid foundation for refurbishment.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property features a small garden to the front and a generous rear garden with ample space for extension work, subject to the necessary planning permission. The sizeable back garden offers excellent scope for those wishing to enlarge the existing accommodation, create additional living space, or develop a private outdoor area to enjoy the coastal surroundings.\r\n\r\nThis is an ideal opportunity for first-time buyers, holiday home seekers, or investors looking to acquire a property in one of West Clare’s most popular seaside locations and add significant value through renovation and improvement."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Kitchen: 1.4 x 3.1. Vinyl floor, wall and base units, sink\r\nLiving Room: 3.1 x 5.0. Laminate floor, fireplace\r\nBedroom 1: 3.1 x 3.8. Laminate floor\r\nBedroom 2: 3.0 x 2.4. Laminate floor\r\nBedroom 3: 2.9 x 2.9. Laminate floor\r\nStorage Room: 2.0 x 2.7. Laminate floor\r\nBathroom: 2.1 x 1.3. Tiled floor, bath, wc, whb"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tIdeal location on the outskirts of the beautiful coastal location of Kilkee.\r\n•\tShort distance from beach and town amenities\r\n•\tIdeal project property with excellent potential for extension and renovation.\r\n•\tSide access and good selection of outbuildings.\r\n•\tBER G 1166.5 kWh/m²/yr. No: 118791615"
      },
      {
